      "canonical_latex": "\\mathbf{B}=\\nabla\\times\\mathbf{A},\\quad \\mathbf{E}=-\\nabla\\phi-\\frac{\\partial\\mathbf{A}}{\\partial t},\\quad \\nabla\\cdot\\mathbf{A}+\\frac{1}{c^2}\\frac{\\partial\\phi}{\\partial t}=0",
